      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从小栗帽创造了奇迹的『有马纪念』开始的\n新生・队伍＜天狼星＞――",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec108a74774051cc5195929880ede8a5ec1be103d4711a73ef3c0c18eec750d",
