    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11d03b9c3f325557092c7fab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新人训练员和新Ace笨拙地一路奔跑着，\n终于组成了一支像样的队伍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0591d66c7056948cbe317331f5f746592f8a77599384cbc419d72d3f1b3369a5",
